        "RefCOCO/+/g（接地数据）",
        "Cap4M（描述数据）",
        "LVIS（评估）",
        "ODinW（评估）",
        "RefCOCO/+/g（评估）"
      ],
      "required_models": [
        "Swin Transformer Tiny/Large（图像骨干网络）",
        "BERT-base（文本骨干网络）",
        "预训练的DINO模型（可选，用于迁移学习）"
      ],
      "compute": "64块NVIDIA A100 GPU，总批量大小64。",
      "code_available": "是，代码和检查点将在 https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO 发布。",
      "steps": [
